SUMMARY:The Saturday Autumn Colours Ashbridges Bay- Walk\, Talk and Good T
 imes!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 \\*Please read carefully\\*\n\nLooking to enjoy the beautiful colours of a
 utumn\, have some great conversations and meet new people? Join us for a r
 elaxed Saturday walk through Ashbridges Bay! We’ll take in the waterfron
 t scenery\, enjoy the fresh air and create plenty of opportunities to talk
 \, laugh and make new friends along the way. Come by yourself or bring a f
 riend—either way\, you’ll receive a warm welcome!\n\n\\*Joined by my o
 ther groups too :)\n\n**Arrive between 2:30 pm and 3:00 pm**\n\n**Where to
  meet us:**\n\nMeetup us outside **Woodbine Station beside bike racks**\n*
 *The Main Woodbine Station Entrance:** Located at the southeast corner of 
 Woodbine Avenue and Strathmore Boulevard.\n\nWe will walk as a group from 
 the station down to Ashbridges Bay\n\\*Most will stick around after for a 
 bite to eat\, ice cream and/or a beverage to sip on :)\n\nFurther details 
 below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\n**Event Detai
 ls:**\n**The Saturday Autumn Colours Ashbridges Bay- Walk\, Talk and Good 
 Times!**\n\nWhat to expect:\n\n* A relaxed walk along the Ashbridges Bay w
 aterfront\n* Ice breaker games to get to know one another\n* Plenty of opp
 ortunities to mix\, mingle and meet new people\n* A comfortable pace that 
 allows everyone to walk and talk\n* Beautiful views of the lake\, beach\, 
 parkland and surrounding area\n* A positive atmosphere for both newcomers 
 and returning members\n\nPlease wear comfortable walking shoes and bring w
 ater\, sunscreen or anything else you may need for the weather. The purpos
 e of this event is simple: get outside\, enjoy the day and make a few new 
 connections!\n\\* Many of us will hit a local pub/restaurant after the wal
 k for dinner and beverages- plan to join us for that if you can\n\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Even
 t Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only) when you arrive (HST is included)\nor e t
 ransfer in advance to [Steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:Steveflemming11@g
 mail.com)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\n\nParking near Woodbine Station:\n(Although I encourage you to tak
 e subway if you can)
