SUMMARY:The Saturday Night Rock\, Dance and Good Times with Friends!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Get ready for a Saturday night of live music\, dancing\, classic rock and 
 good times with friends!\n\nWe’re heading to Smoke Show in Toronto for a
  night with Rude E Bones\, a high-energy GTA cover band bringing classic r
 ock favourites and dance-floor rock hits to the stage.\n\nExpect the kind 
 of music that gets people singing along\, moving onto the dance floor and 
 remembering just how much fun a great Saturday night can be. Whether you c
 ome to dance\, enjoy the band\, meet some new people\, or simply have a dr
 ink and hang out with friends\, you’re very welcome to join us.\n\n\\*Jo
 ined by my other groups too :)\n\nEvent details below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nS
 teve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n─────────────
 ───────────\nEVENT DETAILS\n**The Saturday Night Roc
 k\, Dance and Good Times with Friends!**\nHosted by Steve Flemming\n\nDate
 : Saturday\, October 17\nLocation: Smoke Show\nCity: Toronto\, Ontario\n\n
 🎸 LIVE MUSIC: Rude E Bones\n🎶 Classic Rock • Rock Favourites • D
 ance-Floor Hits\n💃 Dancing\n🍻 Drinks and Food Available\n🎉 Social
 izing and Good Times\n👋 New Members and Solo Attendees Welcome\nThis is
  a social night first and foremost. Come meet some people\, enjoy the musi
 c\, have a drink\, hit the dance floor—or do all four!\n─────
 ───────────────────\n**FRIENDLY REMI
 NDERS**\n• Please be respectful and friendly toward everyone attending\n
 • If you RSVP\, please do your best to attend or update your RSVP if you
 r plans change\n• Food and beverages are purchased individually from the
  venue\n• Please drink responsibly and arrange safe transportation home\
 n• Look for Steve and the Meetup group when you arrive\n• Most importa
 ntly—come ready for some great music and a fun Saturday night!\n\n**Even
 t Fee**: $10 at the door (cash only) or in advance by e-transfer to [steve
 flemming11@gmail.com](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.com)\nPlease mention th
 at you are with Steve's group when you arrive.\nArrival Time: Please arriv
 e between 8:30 PM and 10:00 PM.\n\n**Parking:**\nParking on street and fre
 e parking found in residential area and on Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton
