SUMMARY:Toronto Raptors Season Home Opener Watch Party! 🏀 Raptors vs. C
 hicago Bulls
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n\n
 Basketball is back\, and what better way to celebrate than getting togethe
 r to watch the **Toronto Raptors** take on the Chicago Bulls in their regu
 lar season home opener!\n\nJoin us for a fun Wednesday evening at **The Ph
 easant**\, where we'll enjoy the game on some great big-screen TVs\, along
  with good food\, drinks\, conversation and plenty of Raptors spirit!\n\nW
 hether you're a passionate basketball fan or simply enjoy a lively social 
 atmosphere\, this is a great opportunity to meet new people\, catch up wit
 h friends and cheer on our hometown team!\nComing on your own? Even better
 ! It's a wonderful opportunity to meet fellow Raptors fans and make some n
 ew friends.\n\nJoined by my other groups too! :)\n\nDetails below:\n\nSinc
 erely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\nSoul City Social Club\n\n***\
 n\nEVENT DETAILS\n\nTORONTO RAPTORS SEASON HOME OPENER WATCH PARTY!\n\nTor
 onto Raptors vs. Chicago Bulls\nWednesday\, October 21\, 2026 — 7:00 PM\
 nHosted by Steve Flemming — Soul City Social Club\nLocation: The Pheasan
 t: A Firkin Pub\n1999 Avenue Road\, Toronto\n(Please mention Steve with Me
 etup when you arrive.)\nFree Parking in Residential area\n\nGame: Toronto 
 Raptors vs. Chicago Bulls — Season Home Opener\n\n**Admission Fee:** $2 
 per person\, payable in cash at the door or by e-transfer in advance to st
 eveflemming11@gmail.com\n\nFood & Drinks: Food and drink specials availabl
 e. Everyone is responsible for their own purchases.\n\n***\n\nLet's enjoy 
 a great evening of basketball\, friendship\, laughter and some good old-fa
 shioned Toronto Raptors excitement!\n\nLooking forward to seeing everyone 
 there!\n\nGo Raptors Go! 🏀
